# Haxe 4.3.7 oracle for the throwing-default fixture: Haxe js target via the
# boring std shadow (samples/std/Console.hx) for output. Plain Haxe semantics
# (spec 22 Oracle standing: the stage-1 side runs haxe's own optional-argument
# semantics), no Intercept.
# Run: haxe tests/haxe/throwing-default/oracle.hxml -js <run>/oracle/oracle.js
-lib boring
-cp samples
-cp tests/haxe/throwing-default
-main throwdef.ThrowingDefaultOps
-D oracle-output
